Ih, ad ṭṭseɣ. Tzemreḍ ad iyi-d-tessakiḍ ma teniḍ-d '{wake_word}, kker-d'.
Ihi, ad ṛuḥeɣ ad gneɣ. Tzemreḍ ad iyi-d-tessakiḍ ma teniḍ-d '{wake_word}, kker-d'.
Ad ṭṭseɣ tura. Ini-d '{wake_word}, kker-d' akken ad iyi-d-tessakiḍ.
Ad ṭṭseɣ. Ini-d '{wake_word}, kker-d' akken ad d-terreḍ lweh-iw tikkelt nniḍen.
